  m_text: '1. Choose a destination and tap <b>Start navigation</b>.

    2. Scan
    the nearest campus marker with your camera.

    3. Follow the arrows on the
    floor. <color=#FFCC1A>Yellow</color> arrows lead to your next turn.

    4. If
    the arrows drift or tracking is lost, scan any marker again to recalibrate.

    5.
    You can stop or restart the route at any time.


    <b>Safety:</b> Watch your
    surroundings, not only the screen.'
